{"name":"Adieu","hex":"#b7c1be","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"adieu","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Said to wish a final farewell; goodbye."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A farewell, a goodbye; especially a fond farewell, or a lasting or permanent farewell."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/adieu"}],"entries":[{"title":"Adieu (short story)","blocks":[{"text":"Adieu is a short story by Honoré de Balzac. It was published in 1830 in La Mode. It is one of the Études philosophiques of La Comédie humaine."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/BalzacAdieu01.jpg/330px-BalzacAdieu01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adieu_(short_story)"},{"title":"Adieu (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Adieu. is a fifteen-song album released by Logan Lynn on September 23, 2016."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/9f/Cover_art_for_Logan_Lynn%27s_2016_Release_ADIEU.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adieu_(album)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"adieu":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/En-us-adieu.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/En-us-adieu.ogg/En-us-adieu.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/En-us-adieu.oga?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/93/En-us-adieu.oga/En-us-adieu.oga.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/En-us-adieu_2.oga?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm